Package: DemosMiscanLung
Type: Package
Title: Microsimulation Model for Lung Cancer Screening in Singapore
Version: 0.0.1
Date: 2026-04-20
Authors@R: person("Yichen", "He", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "e0732876@u.nus.edu")
Description: DemosMiscanLung implements a discrete event microsimulation model for evaluating
    lung cancer screening policies. The model simulates individual life histories including smoking
    exposure, lung cancer natural history (onset, progression through stages, and outcomes),
    screening interventions, treatment, and associated costs and quality-adjusted life years (QALYs).
    The model incorporates gender-specific and race-specific risk parameters, family history of lung
    cancer, smoking cessation following diagnosis, and fertility patterns. High-performance C++
    implementations enable efficient population-level simulations and scenario comparisons.
